    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build a house from the ground up by placing and adjusting walls, selecting facade materials and adding windows and doors.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Shape the perfect roof, modify the ceilings, decorate the garden, place furniture, make a balcony or a porch. It's all up to you!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3014340/extras/accd79f281b5743fbd790cf82e210b9b.avif?t=1754424098\" width=616 height=347 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The building system uses optional grid and snapping functionality to give you freedom in designing, while still allowing you to perfectly line up objects when needed.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose from a library of 3000+ objects and materials to craft a space that reflects your unique tastes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3014340/extras/ac2bcb459002b4975ac097bdb1d90783.poster.avif?t=1754424098\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3014340/extras/ac2bcb459002b4975ac097bdb1d90783.webm?t=1754424098\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3014340/extras/ac2bcb459002b4975ac097bdb1d90783.mp4?t=1754424098\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <br>Express your style by tailoring every aspect to your preferences.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3014340/extras/a397944f3ae773d4ddfb2ec2d18435da.poster.avif?t=1754424098\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3014340/extras/a397944f3ae773d4ddfb2ec2d18435da.webm?t=1754424098\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3014340/extras/a397944f3ae773d4ddfb2ec2d18435da.mp4?t=1754424098\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enter First Person Mode and take a tour of your dream house.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3014340/extras/69bcac61ce196498a3382959b5168b3d.poster.avif?t=1754424098\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3014340/extras/69bcac61ce196498a3382959b5168b3d.webm?t=1754424098\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3014340/extras/69bcac61ce196498a3382959b5168b3d.mp4?t=1754424098\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take pictures of your house in Photo Mode and share your best creations with the world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3014340/extras/498d2177a0e107af4fef0f02f3b728ac.avif?t=1754424098\" width=616 height=347 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dream Home Designer  fully utilizes dynamic ray traced lighting, high resolution textures and detailed models for an immersive experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build a house from the ground up by placing and adjusting walls, selecting facade materials and adding windows and doors.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Shape the perfect roof, modify the ceilings, decorate the garden, place furniture, make a balcony or a porch. It's all up to you!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3014340/extras/accd79f281b5743fbd790cf82e210b9b.avif?t=1754424098\" width=616 height=347 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The building system uses optional grid and snapping functionality to give you freedom in designing, while still allowing you to perfectly line up objects when needed.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose from a library of 3000+ objects and materials to craft a space that reflects your unique tastes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3014340/extras/ac2bcb459002b4975ac097bdb1d90783.poster.avif?t=1754424098\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3014340/extras/ac2bcb459002b4975ac097bdb1d90783.webm?t=1754424098\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3014340/extras/ac2bcb459002b4975ac097bdb1d90783.mp4?t=1754424098\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <br>Express your style by tailoring every aspect to your preferences.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3014340/extras/a397944f3ae773d4ddfb2ec2d18435da.poster.avif?t=1754424098\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3014340/extras/a397944f3ae773d4ddfb2ec2d18435da.webm?t=1754424098\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3014340/extras/a397944f3ae773d4ddfb2ec2d18435da.mp4?t=1754424098\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enter First Person Mode and take a tour of your dream house.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3014340/extras/69bcac61ce196498a3382959b5168b3d.poster.avif?t=1754424098\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3014340/extras/69bcac61ce196498a3382959b5168b3d.webm?t=1754424098\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3014340/extras/69bcac61ce196498a3382959b5168b3d.mp4?t=1754424098\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take pictures of your house in Photo Mode and share your best creations with the world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3014340/extras/498d2177a0e107af4fef0f02f3b728ac.avif?t=1754424098\" width=616 height=347 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dream Home Designer  fully utilizes dynamic ray traced lighting, high resolution textures and detailed models for an immersive experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
